sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant O as orchestrator
    participant T as tester
    participant G as tdd-gate.sh
    participant S as spring-agent
    Dev->>O: "Build VET-5."
    O->>O: ROUTE: REFINED STORY (ls .opencode/refined)
    O->>T: task: RED for .opencode/refined/VET-5-*.md
    T->>T: load skill testing-standards, write tests (server/src/test/** only)
    T->>G: red
    G-->>T: GATE PASSED (tests fail, snapshot via git add)
    T-->>O: AC → test table + GATE PASSED
    O->>S: task: GREEN for VET-5
    S->>S: load skills, edit server/src/main/**
    S->>G: green
    G-->>S: GATE PASSED (build ok, tests unchanged)
    S-->>O: changed files + GATE PASSED
    O->>G: green (trust, but verify)
    G-->>O: GATE PASSED
    O-->>Dev: summary per AC — "review the diff, then /done VET-5"
